This package uses the "3.0 (quilt)" source format.

Patches are applied automatically by dpkg-source during build. To
manage patches, you can use the quilt tool:

  quilt push -a    # apply all patches
  quilt pop -a     # remove all patches
  quilt new patchname  # create a new patch
  quilt add file    # add a file to the current patch

For more information, see:
  https://wiki.debian.org/UsingQuilt
  man quilt